      "side": 1,
      "message": "In a separate CL, create `temp_sensor_read()` in zephyr/shim/src/temp_sensors.c.\n\nSo this file would have\n```\n#ifndef CONFIG_ZEPHYR\nint temp_sensor_read(enum temp_sensor_id id, int *temp_ptr)\n{\n\tconst struct temp_sensor_t *sensor;\n\n\tif (id \u003c 0 || id \u003e\u003d TEMP_SENSOR_COUNT)\n\t\treturn EC_ERROR_INVAL;\n\tsensor \u003d temp_sensors + id;\n\n\treturn sensor-\u003eread(sensor-\u003eidx, temp_ptr);\n}\n#endif\n```\n\nThe Zephyr file  would have:\n\n```\nint temp_sensor_read(enum temp_sensor_id id, int *temp_ptr)\n{\n\tconst struct temp_sensor_t *sensor;\n\n\tif (id \u003c 0 || id \u003e\u003d TEMP_SENSOR_COUNT)\n\t\treturn EC_ERROR_INVAL;\n\tsensor \u003d temp_sensors + id;\n\t\n\treturn sensor-\u003eread(sensor, temp_ptr);\n}\n```",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 23,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 23,
        "endChar": 59
      },
      "revId": "6ae8786f46faf4b66ac3f53ff69deca8d974b51f",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
