      "message": "This should be a `struct gpio_dt_spec` since this is only used by Zephyr code.\n\nYou may need to hide this inside zephyr/shim/src/temp_sensors.c\n\nSomething like:\n```\n#ifdef CONFIG_ZEPHYR\n     struct zephyr_temp_sensor *zephyr_info;\n#else\n     int (*read)(int idx, int *temp_ptr);\n#endif\n```\n\nThen declare and allocate storage for `struct zephyr_temp_sensor` in the shim driver.",
